// all stay on disk as inventory for the next brand — nothing was deleted, and the
// earlier brands' hues still inside them are expected drift.
//
// Eight widgets this template usually offers are deliberately absent, and they are
// named without their file extension on purpose because the playbook's "is this
// component live?" check is a bare-filename grep: ProviderGrid and ProviderGridPremium
